#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0467 expect=noViolation domain=SUPPLB
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when --STDTC is present in a Findings general observation class dataset, where its use is not recommended.
#note "EC-36 SUPP pin, negative twin: a conformant SUPPLB carries only the supplemental-qualifier columns, so the bare STDTC that --STDTC now resolves to is absent and the rule stays quiet. Guards the empty prefix against over-firing. ⚠ CLASS-UNREACHABLE IN PRODUCTION, recorded 2026-09-19 (review round 1): CDISC-CG0467 scopes Classes.Include [FINDINGS] - inherited from CORE-000207, which this fixture was MIGRATED from by PLAN-retire-core-family phase 5 - and SUPPLB is in no DomainClassMap family (only SUPPQUAL is) and the fixture carries RDOMAIN rather than DOMAIN, so CustomDomainClassDetector checks the BARE suffixes and QNAM makes it RELATIONSHIP, not FINDINGS. So DatasetRuleResolver does not emit the rule for this dataset and the scenario cannot fail for the reason it was written. The harness cannot say so: with no class= declaration AbstractRuleTestSuitesFactory.describeScopeMismatch routes the class axis to describeAdamClassMismatch, which deliberately refuses SDTM class scopes and returns null. ⛔ Do NOT delete it - it is now this rule's only SUPPLB coverage and ScenarioFixtureCoverageRatchetTest credits it; the production-reachable pair is the two class=FINDINGS LB fixtures beside it. ⚑ Measured against the OFFLINE class path (DomainClassMap then CustomDomainClassDetector), which is what an unlicensed run and this harness both use; with the CDISC Library reachable the product reverse-walk runs first and may answer differently for a SUPP or AP dataset - it cannot for AE, which is EVENTS on every path."
dataset SUPPLB label="Supplemental Qualifiers for LB"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col RDOMAIN type=Char label="Related Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col IDVAR type=Char label="Identifying Variable"
col IDVARVAL type=Char label="Identifying Variable Value"
col QNAM type=Char label="Qualifier Variable Name"
col QVAL type=Char label="Data Value"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | LB | 01-701-1015 | LBSEQ | 1 | LBREASND | Not done
---
